{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026jHSU7wMyQi1792981010.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>巴西總統選舉，高等選舉法院公布，總統盧拉在第二輪投票中勝出，成功連任，將是他第四個總統任期。</p><p></p><p>投票結果出爐後，盧拉現身聖保羅發表講話。他表示，巴西「不是任何人的後院」。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BRA.ELEX-0901_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263ostIdoHkN1792981011.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>選舉法院指，已點算逾九成九選票，80歲的盧拉得票率接近五成二，擊敗只有四成八得票、前總統博爾索納羅兒子、自由黨的弗拉維奧。弗拉維奧拒絕承認選舉結果。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BRA.ELEX-0901_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026YuHCtWUz6w1792981023.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>投票原定當地時間下午五點結束，但因天氣惡劣影響交通。法院應雙方團隊要求，將投票時間延長兩小時。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:25.914606+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T02:38:15.573596+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:49.859590+00:00","content_hash":"e9322a3650e01d4d197b0302dc443e62263dfb618cc16d1db7acd46c801ed4a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:25.914606+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}